        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your teeth are replaced with the large, hollow incisors of a vampire, designed to tear into flesh. You gain a jaws unarmed attack that deals 1d4 piercing damage, is in the knife group, and has the agile, finesse, and unarmed traits. If you hit a creature that's taking persistent bleed damage with your jaws unarmed attack, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to half your level, rounded up, that last for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Ripping Teeth</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span></p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was a successful Strike with your jaws unarmed attack</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You rip through your prey's flesh. The target of the required Strike takes 1d4 persistent bleed damage.</p>"
